@startuml
title AI Assistance Sequence Diagram

actor "Primary User" as User
participant "OmniDesk AI" as System
participant "AI Assistance Service" as Assist
participant "AI Service Provider" as AI
database "Communication Store" as Store

User -> System : request summary or reply suggestion
System -> Store : retrieve selected conversation
Store --> System : conversation data
System -> Assist : create approved AI request
Assist -> AI : send minimized conversation context

alt AI request succeeds
  AI --> Assist : summary or reply suggestion
  Assist --> System : AI-generated result
  System --> User : display result for review
  User -> System : edit, accept, or discard result
else AI request fails
  AI --> Assist : failure response
  Assist --> System : AI unavailable status
  System --> User : display failure without blocking core features
end

note over User,System
AI output never sends content autonomously.
Message sending requires explicit user approval.
end note

@enduml